**Analyzing rig gearbox hierarchy**
**Refining GLB transform and bounds processing**

I’m exploring how to use rig.gearboxRoot.matrix directly for assemblies, verifying that static TRS data may be sufficient, and considering how to document this simplification. I’m also looking into runtime light management with proper disposal methods and testing JSON-based GLB metadata parsing to extract node transforms and bounding boxes without decoding full geometry, aiming to support precise measurement comparisons and robust test setups without WebGL dependency.
